{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0614E0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，你对绘画感兴趣吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":35,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不知道。别对我抱太大期待。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"毕加索你总该知道吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"嗯，只知道名字。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"就是去年。立体主义的创始人——“我们法国的”！哼哼！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"法国引以为傲的艺术家，毕加索先生……很遗憾在法国南部去世了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"嗯？我记得他是西班牙人……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"喂，你知道他的全名吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"巴勃罗·毕加索。从名字也看得出来，他是西班牙的……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":77,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"哼。说到绘画，你还真是个凡人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"什么意思？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"仔细听好了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"“巴勃罗·迭戈·何塞·弗朗西斯科·德·保拉·胡安·内波穆塞诺·玛丽亚·德·洛斯·雷梅迪奥斯·克里斯平……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":144,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"……克里斯皮亚诺·德·拉·桑蒂西玛·特立尼达·鲁伊斯·伊·毕加索”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"……怎么样？这就是他的全名。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"不，就算你这么说……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"他可是现代艺术巨匠啊？一生大半时间都在法国活动，创作了超过10万件作品的伟人啊？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":116,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"作为基本教养，当然应该能背出来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"感觉没什么用得上的地方……。算了先不说这个，毕加索是西班牙人吧？没错吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"不是法国人。对吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"Cécile？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":10,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"那又怎样？不管是西班牙人还是火星人都无所谓，毕加索就是毕加索。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"他在法国活跃过的事实不会改变，作品的价值也丝毫不会因此受损！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"纠结国籍这种事，你也太小家子气了。“无国界之师”这个名字都要哭了吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"那既然这样，也没必要让“我们法国”来引以为傲吧……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"你说什么！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""}]}